# Memory facets are JSONL from the one-memory-cycle on (B2): one
# canonical JSON object per line, written only by promote. union merge
# is sound for that line-oriented form - parallel branches' promotes
# concatenate, and exact-claim dedupe erases any doubled line.
# (_patches journals stay pretty-printed JSON and get NO union rule:
# line-merging nested JSON corrupts it.)
*.memory merge=union
